Ever since I was little, I've loved how different Neon and Black Lobelia's characters are, you know?

98
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:50,220
I cannot tell you what a dream come true this is!

99
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:50,960
For sure.

100
