102
00:07:55,520 --> 00:08:01,180
I was, um, wondering if maybe we could get a picture, like, together.

103
00:08:01,740 --> 00:08:03,740
Okay. I mean, it's whatever.

104
00:08:04,300 --> 00:08:06,440
Are you serious? Oh my gosh, you're the best!

105
00:08:09,700 --> 00:08:12,800
I can't handle this right now! Thank you so much!

106
00:08:13,360 --> 00:08:15,040
Would it be okay if I posted it?

107
00:08:15,300 --> 00:08:17,720
If you want, but your makeup's a little runny.

108
