Wow, Juju actually exists!

121
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,760
Of course I exist! What the heck?

122
00:08:47,860 --> 00:08:50,220
When you never go to live events, people start to wonder!

123
00:08:50,220 --> 00:08:54,000
Hey, you guys. Sorry for the wait.

124
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,740
Yeah, what took you so long?

125
00:08:55,740 --> 00:09:03,120
No way.

126
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,380
Inui? Can you hear me?

127
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,940
Inui, what's wrong?

128
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,500
Hey, wake up!

129
00:09:12,880 --> 00:09:14,560
I can't believe I did that.

130
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,020
I'm the one who wanted to go and then I ended up fainting like a loser.

131
00:09:18,020 --> 00:09:19,860
It's totally cool, Juju.

132
00:09:20,460 --> 00:09:22,400
Shinjiu and I still went and checked it all out.

133
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:25,700
Yeah, and I took pictures so we can look at them together when we get home.

134
00:09:26,020 --> 00:09:26,680
Thank you.

135
00:09:27,180 --> 00:09:28,780
You were worse off than I realized.

136
00:09:29,100 --> 00:09:30,960
I'm so sorry. I should have noticed.

137
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:36,260
Well, I feel much better now.

138
00:09:36,920 --> 00:09:39,020
Awesome. So are we ready to call it a day?

139
00:09:39,360 --> 00:09:40,200
I think so.

140
00:09:40,520 --> 00:09:41,080
Okay, cool.

141
00:09:41,340 --> 00:09:44,120
I'm meeting up with Noah and some friends, so I'm gonna bounce for now.

142
00:09:44,900 --> 00:09:47,800
We figured we'd hype ourselves up for finals with some karaoke!

143
00:09:48,020 --> 00:09:49,280
Or you could just study.

144
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:51,200
Later days, you guys!

145
00:09:51,520 --> 00:09:52,000
See you.

146
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:54,180
We should probably head out, too.

147
00:09:54,540 --> 00:09:56,540
I've never been to Shin Misato before.

148
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:59,760
Would you mind if I looked at the shops by the station first?

149
00:09:59,920 --> 00:10:00,400
You do you.

150
00:10:00,940 --> 00:10:02,000
I'll just see you at home, then.

151
00:10:02,500 --> 00:10:03,320
Don't be too late.

152
00:10:03,800 --> 00:10:04,100
Okay.

153
00:10:06,240 --> 00:10:07,020
So, um...

154
00:10:07,680 --> 00:10:08,580
Iha, what's up?

155
00:10:08,580 --> 00:10:11,260
Did you have any more questions about the camera before we go?

156
00:10:11,740 --> 00:10:13,040
Oh, no, thank you.

157
00:10:14,660 --> 00:10:17,580
I apologize in advance if I'm wrong, but...

158
00:10:18,020 --> 00:10:20,480
I kind of feel like...

159
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:21,240
I don't know.

160
00:10:22,020 --> 00:10:24,780
Maybe you might be interested in cosplay after all.

161
00:10:26,020 --> 00:10:31,120
When we were at lunch the other day, I wondered if it was too hard to admit it in front of your sister.

162
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:35,700
Oh, I'm so sorry.

163
00:10:36,040 --> 00:10:37,220
I don't know what I'm saying.

164
00:10:37,660 --> 00:10:38,860
Please forget I mentioned it.

165
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:39,860
I'll leave you alone.

166
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:42,260
Oh, wait.

167
00:10:43,100 --> 00:10:44,940
I would like to try it, actually.

168
00:10:46,460 --> 00:10:47,540
There is one.

169
00:10:47,960 --> 00:10:49,440
A character that I love.

170
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,440
I thought maybe someday.

171
00:10:52,820 --> 00:10:54,060
Maureen was right, you know?

172
00:10:54,600 --> 00:11:00,080
I see how much fun my sister has cosplaying, and it's hard watching from the sidelines.

173
00:11:00,620 --> 00:11:01,100
Then why?

174
00:11:01,180 --> 00:11:01,760
I can't.

175
00:11:02,580 --> 00:11:03,720
It's complicated.

176
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:08,300
Thing is, I wouldn't be a good fit at all.

177
00:11:09,720 --> 00:11:12,220
My sister might, but I'm not cute like her.

178
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,540
And my body type's all wrong.

179
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:18,020
I'm basically different from this character in every way.

180
00:11:18,820 --> 00:11:21,420
I'd look so ridiculous if I dressed up like that.

181
00:11:21,900 --> 00:11:23,780
It would feel like I was being insulting.

182
00:11:24,720 --> 00:11:26,240
That's why I never tried.

183
00:11:26,240 --> 00:11:33,620
And, well, that end, if I ever did a horrible cosplay, I know I would embarrass my sister.

184
00:11:34,200 --> 00:11:36,560
And I wouldn't be able to handle it if she hated me.

185
00:11:37,140 --> 00:11:38,820
Plus, I'm too scared.

186
00:11:42,660 --> 00:11:44,040
That's confusing to me.

187
00:11:44,560 --> 00:11:49,880
When I was at the live event, I saw so many people enjoying cosplay for the first time.

188
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:56,000
And I remember thinking that the best thing about cosplay is that you can become anything you want.

189
00:11:56,240 --> 00:12:02,540
So I say, if you're curious about it at all, you should try it.

190
00:12:03,280 --> 00:12:05,080
And I'll help you.

191
00:12:06,660 --> 00:12:09,940
Also, I've seen how much your sister loves you.

192
00:12:10,200 --> 00:12:12,380
And I don't think she would ever judge you, Inui.

193
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,960
Thank you, Kojo.

194
00:12:17,700 --> 00:12:18,820
That means a lot.

195
00:12:19,380 --> 00:12:21,100
I would really appreciate your help.

196
00:12:21,660 --> 00:12:22,060
Great.

197
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:23,120
Then let's do it.

198
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:26,540
So tell me, what series do you want to cosplay from?

199
00:12:26,820 --> 00:12:28,340
Actually, I hope you don't mind.

200
00:12:28,920 --> 00:12:31,920
My character is also from Flower Princess Blaze.

201
00:12:32,300 --> 00:12:32,640
Really?

202
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,500
That's cool.

203
00:12:33,900 --> 00:12:35,280
I wonder which one it is.

204
00:12:35,580 --> 00:12:38,820
She said it was someone totally different from her, so maybe it's the heroine.

205
00:12:38,920 --> 00:12:39,220
Mirai!

206
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:40,580
Okay, don't laugh.

207
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:43,140
I've always wanted to try cosplaying so much.

208
00:12:43,340 --> 00:12:44,460
Wait, you mean the brother?

209
00:12:44,460 --> 00:12:47,500
I've always looked up to him for so many reasons.

210
00:12:47,700 --> 00:12:48,980
He's strong, he's cool.

211
00:12:49,360 --> 00:12:53,340
And whenever his little sister Mirai is in trouble, he's the first one to step up and help her.

212
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:57,740
I think he's my favorite because he reminds me so much of my sister.

213
00:12:58,420 --> 00:12:59,080
I see.

214
00:12:59,500 --> 00:13:02,940
You know, I bet you could be part of the Blaze cosplay group with the others.

215
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:05,060
I'm sure they'd both be thrilled to have you.

216
00:13:05,060 --> 00:13:06,480
Oh, that would be fun.

217
00:13:06,920 --> 00:13:09,300
But could you keep it a secret until the day of?

218
00:13:09,380 --> 00:13:11,560
Since it's my first time, I'm a little embarrassed.

219
00:13:11,900 --> 00:13:12,560
Of course.

220
00:13:13,140 --> 00:13:15,780
So, um, do you really think I can pull it off?

221
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,100
Yeah, why not?

222
00:13:17,500 --> 00:13:22,800
Because I, um, I have a hard time finding clothes that can fit me right on top.

223
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,240
Yeah, those might be hard to work around.

224
00:13:25,920 --> 00:13:30,080
Also, I only have my allowance so I don't have a lot of money to spend.

225
00:13:30,080 --> 00:13:32,160
That's right, I forgot.

226
00:13:32,440 --> 00:13:33,680
She's still in middle school.

227
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:36,380
She looks so much older, but she can't even work yet.

228
00:13:36,760 --> 00:13:37,800
That's gonna be rough.

229
00:13:38,160 --> 00:13:39,440
Materials cost a lot.

230
00:13:39,920 --> 00:13:40,820
What am I thinking?

231
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:41,860
It's fine.

232
00:13:42,180 --> 00:13:43,480
Cosplay doesn't have to be expensive.

233
00:13:43,740 --> 00:13:45,560
It's all about creativity and imagination.

234
00:13:45,960 --> 00:13:48,420
Everyone should be able to do it, even with limited funds.

235
00:13:48,660 --> 00:13:50,880
There has to be a way I can do this for her.

236
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:52,160
Think, dummy, think.

237
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:56,000
If that sounds too difficult, please don't worry about it.

238
00:13:56,080 --> 00:13:56,280
No.

239
00:13:57,400 --> 00:13:58,360
I'll figure it out.

240
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:58,980
Don't worry.

241
00:14:00,080 --> 00:14:05,440
Let's start with the outfit first.

242
00:14:05,780 --> 00:14:06,180
Okay.

243
00:14:06,720 --> 00:14:09,100
We can easily use this uniform for the base.

244
00:14:09,460 --> 00:14:11,080
Is this your uniform, Gojo?

245
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:11,920
Yeah.

246
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:15,020
I thought about it, and I remembered watching Flower Princess Blaze

247
00:14:15,020 --> 00:14:17,640
and thinking the uniform Soma and Sakuya were wearing

248
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:19,340
looked a lot like the one from my school.

249
00:14:19,420 --> 00:14:21,000
You're right, it totally does.

250
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:23,140
You're sure it's okay if I borrow it?

251
00:14:23,280 --> 00:14:23,520
Yeah.

252
00:14:23,940 --> 00:14:26,080
I don't know if it'll fit you as is, but...

253
00:14:26,080 --> 00:14:26,860
Let's see.

254
00:14:26,860 --> 00:14:32,540
It's a good thing Kitakawa wasn't the one wanting to cosplay Soma.

255
00:14:33,180 --> 00:14:34,860
Dude, these are huge on me.

256
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,580
There's no way she'd fit into my uniform.

257
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:38,840
Gojo, it works!

258
00:14:38,920 --> 00:14:39,880
I'm wearing it!

259
00:14:40,040 --> 00:14:40,360
Great!

260
00:14:41,120 --> 00:14:41,860
How's it...

261
00:14:41,860 --> 00:14:59,200
I'm so sorry about the buttons.

262
00:14:59,200 --> 00:15:00,120
I'll pay for it.

263
00:15:00,120 --> 00:15:01,420
You knew it, please!

264
00:15:01,580 --> 00:15:02,320
Cover up!

265
00:15:02,840 --> 00:15:04,420
I'm so sorry, Gojo.

266
00:15:04,900 --> 00:15:05,600
It's fine.

267
00:15:06,040 --> 00:15:07,560
I'll have these sewn on in no time.

268
00:15:08,380 --> 00:15:10,100
It seemed to be around the right size, though.

269
00:15:10,380 --> 00:15:11,560
I'll just hem it a bit for you.

270
00:15:11,700 --> 00:15:11,980
Yeah.

271
00:15:12,380 --> 00:15:14,820
He wears his sleeves rolled up, so the length was great.

272
00:15:15,300 --> 00:15:16,940
My main concern is your bo...

273
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:18,700
Body.

274
00:15:18,940 --> 00:15:21,100
And what we can do to help make it look more like a guy's.

275
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:21,880
Right.

276
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,640
At this point, she's just wearing a guy's uniform.

277
00:15:25,260 --> 00:15:26,760
That doesn't feel much like cosplay.

278
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:31,860
I have to find a way to make her chest less noticeable, and her physique look more like a boy's.

279
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:34,380
I never had this issue with Hina dolls.

280
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:37,160
Of course, they're all wearing kimonos, so no buttons.

281
00:15:38,420 --> 00:15:38,780
Kimono!

282
00:15:39,360 --> 00:15:39,960
That's it!

283
00:15:41,060 --> 00:15:42,340
Let's try a sarashi wrap.

284
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,360
We can use it to give you a straighter shape.

285
00:15:44,700 --> 00:15:46,680
It'll help with the illusion of being a male character.

286
00:15:47,100 --> 00:15:47,540
What do you think?

287
00:15:47,620 --> 00:15:48,140
Want to try it?

288
00:15:48,420 --> 00:15:49,360
Sounds good to me.

289
00:15:52,320 --> 00:15:53,500
Now that I think of it,

290
00:15:53,500 --> 00:15:56,860
Kitagawa wore two of those padded bra things for Shizuku-tan.

291
00:15:58,220 --> 00:16:02,220
These cosplayers are willing to change their face, body, or entire appearance

292
00:16:02,220 --> 00:16:04,640
just for the sake of looking like a character.

293
00:16:07,200 --> 00:16:07,600
But...

294
00:16:08,140 --> 00:16:09,940
It's the ultimate form of love!

295
00:16:10,240 --> 00:16:12,180
I love her so much, I want to be her!

296
00:16:13,720 --> 00:16:15,780
I think I understand why now.

297
00:16:16,740 --> 00:16:19,320
It's because they love these characters so much.

298
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:33,360
My stomach doesn't stand out as much anymore.

299
00:16:33,900 --> 00:16:35,500
But my chest is still there.

300
00:16:36,100 --> 00:16:36,900
Oh, is it?

301
00:16:37,500 --> 00:16:39,520
Actually, the shirt is highlighting your curves,

302
00:16:39,700 --> 00:16:41,520
so you are still looking a bit girlish.

303
00:16:41,940 --> 00:16:43,620
Let's alter the shoulders to be squarer.

304
00:16:43,980 --> 00:16:47,220
Soma is really athletic, so that would make him look stronger, too.

305
00:16:47,520 --> 00:16:48,200
Good idea!

306
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,360
Okay, perfect.

307
00:16:49,760 --> 00:16:50,760
That should help a bit.

308
00:16:51,660 --> 00:16:53,340
But her chest is still a problem.

309
00:16:53,780 --> 00:16:56,420
How did those girls dressed as guys at the event handle it?

310
00:16:57,580 --> 00:16:59,420
A bee holder?

311
00:16:59,680 --> 00:17:00,460
What is that?

312
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:01,760
What?

313
00:17:01,840 --> 00:17:03,380
It really flattens it that much?

314
00:17:03,640 --> 00:17:05,140
Look, they have my size, too!

315
00:17:05,320 --> 00:17:07,680
Okay, but I bet that's gonna be expensive.

316
00:17:08,940 --> 00:17:10,240
Or maybe it won't!

317
00:17:10,780 --> 00:17:11,560
No way!

318
00:17:11,760 --> 00:17:14,260
Inui, we can make a man out of you without breaking the bank!

319
00:17:14,780 --> 00:17:15,180
Yay!

320
00:17:15,580 --> 00:17:16,900
I'll buy it right now!

321
00:17:16,900 --> 00:17:19,220
All that's left is the wig!

322
00:17:19,400 --> 00:17:21,140
I'd like to get it next time I'm out shopping.

323
00:17:21,440 --> 00:17:23,600
So, would it be okay if I measured your head?

324
00:17:23,800 --> 00:17:24,780
Of course you can!

325
00:17:26,820 --> 00:17:27,960
Okay, set up straight.

326
00:17:28,300 --> 00:17:30,060
And keep looking for...

327
00:17:30,060 --> 00:17:30,280
Word!

328
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:37,220
I'm so sorry!

329
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,820
I promise I didn't mean to do that!

330
00:17:38,960 --> 00:17:40,080
No, it's totally okay!

331
00:17:40,200 --> 00:17:40,660
I'm sorry!

332
00:17:40,780 --> 00:17:41,900
Let's not talk about it!

333
00:17:45,120 --> 00:17:46,340
Thanks for coming out here.

334
00:17:46,660 --> 00:17:48,140
I know it's a bit of a hike for you.

335
00:17:48,260 --> 00:17:49,000
I don't mind.

336
00:17:49,560 --> 00:17:50,180
Come look!

337
00:17:50,260 --> 00:17:50,960
I got your wig!

338
00:17:52,060 --> 00:17:53,920
Since you want your cosplay to be a surprise,

339
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,660
I thought we should cut it ourselves.

340
00:17:55,660 --> 00:18:00,920
Wow!

341
00:18:01,300 --> 00:18:04,040
He's never cut a wig and he's not hesitating at all!

342
00:18:04,040 --> 00:18:23,760
It's kind of nerve-wracking.

343
00:18:23,760 --> 00:18:28,700
I'm freaking out a little bit.

344
00:18:28,820 --> 00:18:29,820
I don't want to mess it up.

345
00:18:30,620 --> 00:18:31,020
Huh?

346
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:32,420
No!

347
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:33,340
It's fine!

348
00:18:33,840 --> 00:18:36,440
I'm just so relieved that you feel that way sometimes, too.

349
00:18:36,960 --> 00:18:38,200
I definitely do.

350
00:18:38,580 --> 00:18:40,600
But you make the most incredible outfits!

351
00:18:40,980 --> 00:18:43,280
How could someone so talented ever be insecure?

352
00:18:43,720 --> 00:18:44,380
Are you kidding?

353
00:18:44,620 --> 00:18:46,100
There's so much I can't do.

354
00:18:46,260 --> 00:18:47,840
I'm still trying to figure it all out.

355
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:49,000
Do you really mean that?

356
00:18:52,360 --> 00:18:52,800
Yeah.

357
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:56,400
I actually wish I could be more like this classmate I look up to.

358
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:58,240
She's always so positive.

359
00:18:59,020 --> 00:19:00,400
Everyone who meets her loves her.

360
00:19:01,020 --> 00:19:03,600
She's strong and fearless and says whatever's on her mind.

361
00:19:04,020 --> 00:19:06,220
I always thought her life must be so easy.

362
00:19:06,580 --> 00:19:08,480
There was no way she had problems like me.

363
00:19:09,680 --> 00:19:11,100
But then...

364
00:19:11,100 --> 00:19:12,200
One thing led to another,

365
00:19:12,620 --> 00:19:14,480
and I ended up spending a lot of time with her.

366
00:19:14,480 --> 00:19:16,580
And I realized...

367
00:19:16,580 --> 00:19:19,900
She also had things she wanted to do but couldn't.

368
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:21,840
And things didn't always go her way.

369
00:19:22,400 --> 00:19:23,780
She even messed up at times.

370
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,840
She has the same issues I do.

371
00:19:27,540 --> 00:19:29,120
But she always looks happy.

372
00:19:31,260 --> 00:19:33,620
And sometimes she's even kind of cute.

373
00:19:34,360 --> 00:19:34,540
Huh!

374
00:19:35,580 --> 00:19:36,180
Hold on!

375
00:19:36,260 --> 00:19:36,880
Did I say cute?

376
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:38,780
If I did, I swear I didn't mean it like that!

377
00:19:39,340 --> 00:19:40,620
Anyway, uh, what?

378
00:19:40,760 --> 00:19:41,440
Did you say something?

379
00:19:41,720 --> 00:19:43,240
I forgot what I was talking about.

380
00:19:43,240 --> 00:19:44,120
Oh, yeah.

381
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:47,180
My point was,

382
00:19:47,560 --> 00:19:49,640
we don't always know how someone really feels.

383
00:19:49,980 --> 00:19:51,720
But, well, we all have struggles.

384
00:19:52,980 --> 00:19:54,440
Anyway, haircuts!

385
00:19:58,200 --> 00:19:59,920
We all have struggles.

386
00:20:00,540 --> 00:20:01,440
Even her?

387
00:20:02,660 --> 00:20:04,820
I never thought about it that way.

388
00:20:05,460 --> 00:20:06,580
Okay, let's do your makeup.

389
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,620
I found everything you need at the 100 yen shop.

390
00:20:09,920 --> 00:20:12,020
I got this entire bag for under 10,000.

391
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,460
Wow, thank you so much!

392
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:18,540
Looks good.

393
00:20:18,700 --> 00:20:19,620
Let's do your eyes next.

394
00:20:20,660 --> 00:20:22,640
To make your eyes look a little more masculine,

395
00:20:22,860 --> 00:20:24,980
we'll extend the eyeliner a bit further than normal.

396
00:20:25,300 --> 00:20:26,900
And the last thing we'll do is adjust the wig.

397
00:20:26,900 --> 00:20:30,060
Oh, there he is.

398
00:20:31,780 --> 00:20:32,300
Oh.

399
00:20:33,740 --> 00:20:34,340
Shinja?

400
00:20:36,740 --> 00:20:46,680
I, um, I, um, I wanted to, I guess, just try, sort of try cosplaying?

401
00:20:46,680 --> 00:20:49,980
No way!

402
00:20:50,120 --> 00:20:51,960
I just, I can't believe it!

403
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:53,120
You look amazing!

404
00:20:53,120 --> 00:20:53,620
Oh my gosh!

405
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:54,880
Seriously, she's been cramped!

406
00:20:54,880 --> 00:20:55,880
I couldn't tell who you were,

407
00:20:55,960 --> 00:20:59,120
but I swear, I thought I was staring at the look of the look of the look.

408
00:20:59,200 --> 00:21:01,200
It was absolutely blowing my mind!

409
00:21:02,500 --> 00:21:03,780
Just so good.

410
00:21:04,080 --> 00:21:04,860
I mean it.

411
00:21:05,100 --> 00:21:05,500
Perfect.

412
00:21:05,500 --> 00:21:05,720
Perfect.

413
00:21:06,660 --> 00:21:07,920
I'm so impressed.

414
00:21:07,920 --> 00:21:13,260
Do you like it?

415
00:21:18,400 --> 00:21:18,840
Yes.

416
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:20,700
So, question.

417
00:21:21,080 --> 00:21:22,560
What'd you do with your yabos?

418
00:21:22,780 --> 00:21:23,740
They're like M.I.A.

419
00:21:23,740 --> 00:21:27,020
I strapped them down with a compression band and a sabashi wrap.

420
00:21:27,300 --> 00:21:29,460
And Gojo sewed in some shoulder pads for me.

421
00:21:29,660 --> 00:21:31,000
You still have a girl face!

422
00:21:31,680 --> 00:21:32,440
Girl face?

423
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,860
You've got like this powerful presence of a dude,

424
00:21:34,940 --> 00:21:36,560
but your face still looks so girly!

425
00:21:36,940 --> 00:21:39,520
The contrast is so cool, and I seriously can't with you!

426
00:21:39,940 --> 00:21:42,380
Oh my gosh, Shinju, can we take a few selfies together?

427
00:21:42,840 --> 00:21:43,640
Pretty, please?

428
00:21:48,140 --> 00:21:48,540
Sure.

429
00:21:50,340 --> 00:21:51,160
Okay, cute!

430
00:21:51,460 --> 00:21:52,780
One more, and this time...

431
00:21:52,780 --> 00:21:55,000
I think we should get started before our time runs out.

432
00:21:55,360 --> 00:21:55,960
That's right!

433
00:21:56,120 --> 00:21:57,320
I forgot we're paying air relief!

434
00:21:57,560 --> 00:21:58,640
Shinju, can you get the camera?

435
00:21:59,000 --> 00:21:59,760
Yep, on it!

436
00:21:59,760 --> 00:22:03,260
That camera is really not cheap!

437
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:05,100
We're crying out loud, you guys!

438
00:22:05,100 --> 00:22:05,140
It's fine, you guys!

439
00:22:05,140 --> 00:22:06,140
Yeah, it's fine.

440
00:22:06,560 --> 00:22:07,020
It's fine, you guys!

441
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:25,580
Coupè s belle

442
00:22:25,580 --> 00:22:55,560
Thank you.

443
00:22:55,580 --> 00:23:25,560
Thank you.

444
00:23:25,580 --> 00:23:27,580
Thank you.

